  69:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c **** //    <q1> Enable High Speed External Crystal Oscillator (HSE)
  70:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c **** //          <i> Default HSE = DISABLE
