 139:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c **** /* !!! NOTICE !!!
 140:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****  * How to adjust the value of High Speed External oscillator (HSE)?
 141:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    The default value of HSE is define by "HSE_VALUE" in "ht32lxxxxx_nn.h".
 142:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    If your board uses a different HSE speed, please add a new compiler preprocessor
 143:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    C define, "HSE_VALUE=n000000" ("n" represents n MHz) in the toolchain/IDE,
 144:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    or edit the "HSE_VALUE" in the "ht32l5xxxx_conf.h" file.
 145:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    Take Keil MDK-ARM for instance, to set HSE as 16 MHz:
 146:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\system_ht32l5xxxx_01.c ****    "Option of Target -> C/C++ > Preprocessor Symbols"
